pares for Anz and her crew's arrival to Crimonia, but there is still a lot to do. She discovers that a girl name Sherry has an amazing talent, but that talent has put the little girl into a dilemma.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1NKS839j9nkifYxm2hmqpsnGtik.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15945","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"127550","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"45486","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"97782","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"386572","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"70556","synopsis":"Fina discovers that her current iron knife can't cut through the tough fur of the black tiger and Yuna takes her to get a stronger replacement. However, Yuna finds out about the existence of mithril at the blacksmith's and begins a quest to obtain it!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l3EuKksqgkJzn4u4XnOEsWDXBPp.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15945","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"127550","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"45486","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"97782","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"386572","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"70658","synopsis":"Yuna dreams about being the hero that saves Princess Fina as she finishes the golem hunting quest for the sake of obtaining mithril. Golems infinitely spawn? The tunnel might collapse if she goes all out? Even a mithril golem? Yuna will challenge it all!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/peWnQKgfj6X2SfFZHCDsrtOvDcz.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"